          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono-tech font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Infraestructura</span>
            <span class="text-[#1a4b8c] dark:text-[#2b6cb5] font-mono-tech font-bold">14 Sep 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-display font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 italic">Informe táctico en redacción...</h3>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg bg-[#f8f4ea]/50 dark:bg-[#1a1a1a]/50 border border-[#e8e0d0] dark:border-[#2a2a2a] opacity-70">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded h-40 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Próximamente" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono-tech font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Regulación</span>
            <span class="text-[#1a4b8c] dark:text-[#2b6cb5] font-mono-tech font-bold">17 Sep 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-display font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 italic">Informe táctico en redacción...</h3>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg bg-[#f8f4ea]/50 dark:bg-[#1a1a1a]/50 border border-[#e8e0d0] dark:border-[#2a2a2a] opacity-70">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded h-40 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Próximamente" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono-tech font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">GEO2035+</span>
            <span class="text-[#1a4b8c] dark:text-[#2b6cb5] font-mono-tech font-bold">21 Sep 2026</span>
